				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2155.005,
							109.349,
							11195.66
						],
						"pointId": 360300006
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760520201,
					"content": "Hmm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520202,
					"content": "So, what do you think?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520203,
					"content": "It reminds me of a time long, long ago, when I was living with the Frostmoon Scions...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520204,
					"content": "The people used to make a kind of tea brewed with fresh mint leaves, spices, and dried berries.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520205,
					"content": "Whenever I passed by their homes, there was always a subtle herbal aroma wafting from the windows...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520206,
					"content": "Did you ever get to try it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520207,
					"content": "I wanted to, but never got the chance.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520208,
					"content": "Oh, why not...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520209,
					"content": "When a \"Goddess\" arrives at your door and asks, \"May I try your tea?\"... No one dares to offer up the \"rustic tea\" thrown together for their own consumption...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520210,
					"content": "Ah... Yeah.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520211,
					"content": "What I received in the end was more like an \"offering\" for the divine, complete with ornate packaging and all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520212,
					"content": "Not that it tasted bad, per se... But, it was missing that sense of... \"home.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520213,
					"content": "Well, now we can fix that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760520214,
					"content": "Mmm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520215,
					"content": "The flavor is delightful.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520216,
					"content": "...Though I must say, the idea of adding milk seems quite unorthodox to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520217,
					"content": "Ah, well this is a Mondstadt recipe. People love adding milk, cream, and sugar to their tea over there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520218,
					"content": "It's novel... but in a good way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520219,
					"content": "Phew, glad you like it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520220,
					"content": "Mm... Thank you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760520221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760520221,
					"content": "It seems moonlight is not the only medium through which one can glimpse the past. Even something as simple as the aroma of a drink can bring back long-forgotten memories...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				}
			]
		},
